Committed provider cassettes land here (Build F chunk 11).

Recorded on the dev machine with:
    SEEDGRAPH_VCR_RECORD=1 pytest -m network tests/test_provider_cassettes.py
then committed after the scrub grep passes:
    grep -ri "mailto=\|x-api-key\|authorization" tests/fixtures/provider_cassettes/
(must match only REDACTED). Until a provider's {name}.json exists, its offline
replay test self-skips, so the chunk is green before the recording session.
